; lake_shore.room - Margem: a freezable lake 17 cells wide (cols 16-32) under a stone causeway three rows above it
; (design 04 section 3.5, Congelar retorno; design 02 section 8 Inverno Espacial 1 without the waterfall). The causeway
; is the way west with no song; Congelar from the east lip (col 33) is the only way to the far bank and its niche (cols 11-15).

